# The scientific value of this package is that every file reproduces its
# recorded SHA-256. Git must therefore perform NO content conversion of any
# kind: no CRLF/LF translation, no smudge/clean filters, no text munging.
# `* -text` guarantees a byte-exact round trip through clone/checkout, so
# 09_REPRODUCIBILITY/validation_scripts/verify_paper_data.py passes on a
# fresh clone exactly as it passes on the machine that built the package.
* -text

# Do not attempt diffs or merges on frozen artifacts.
*.npz   binary
*.parquet binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.psir  binary
